From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:01:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selection and clipboard yanks

The terminal UI supports vim-style visual selection in the focused pane and yanks selected text through OSC52 clipboard output. Ctrl-V stays an internal terminal input mapping so the public UiKey surface does not grow for block visual mode.
